+- 0x05 = not hit any rule
+- 0x06 = unknown RRID
+- 0x07 = error due to a stalled transaction. It should not happen when `ERR_CFG.stall_violation_en` is 0.
+- 0x08 ~ 0x0D = N/A, reserved for future
+- 0x0E ~ 0x0F = user-defined error
